Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.46,0:00:49.23,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Even if they don't match your ideals,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.25,0:00:50.98,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}chase your ambitions in your own way
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.00,0:00:52.81,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Even if they don't match your ideals,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.84,0:00:54.67,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}chase your ambitions in your own way
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.30,0:01:09.16,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}なりたい自分を がむしゃらに追いかけて
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.19,0:01:14.90,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}気がつけば大人になっていた
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.32,0:01:19.96,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}人は誰も思い通り 努力すれば夢叶うって
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.99,0:01:21.80,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}そんな甘くはないストーリー
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.82,0:01:23.88,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}必死こいて上目指しても
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.91,0:01:26.01,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}結果こそ全て 分かってる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.04,0:01:27.14,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}解かってない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.16,0:01:28.89,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}いつかきっと誰か見てる信じ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.91,0:01:31.18,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}今日も歩き続ける
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.21,0:01:33.98,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}諦めそう挫けそう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.00,0:01:36.21,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}から見える景色
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.17,0:01:43.76,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}絶望と苦しみの暗闇のその先
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.64,0:01:49.12,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}果てなき道の先で待つモノ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.14,0:01:52.87,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}遠くてもこの手で掴み取るため
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.90,0:01:56.46,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}理想とは違う夢のカタチ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.48,0:01:58.13,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}追い続けもがきながら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.15,0:02:00.55,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}前に進むだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.57,0:02:02.34,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}今この手にする
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.36,0:02:04.09,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}We change the game from our own side
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.12,0:02:07.72,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}まだ見ぬ世界を自由に生きてく
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.74,0:02:09.51,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Even if they don't match your ideals,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.54,0:02:11.22,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}chase your ambitions in your own way
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.25,0:02:13.10,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Even if they don't match your ideals,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.12,0:02:15.17,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}chase your ambitions in your own way
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.46,0:00:49.23,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}即便与理想中的模样大相径庭
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.25,0:00:50.98,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}也要以自己的方式追逐心中所向
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.00,0:00:52.81,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}即便与理想中的模样大相径庭
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.84,0:00:54.67,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}也要以自己的方式追逐心中所向
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.30,0:01:09.16,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}不顾一切追寻理想的自我 蓦然回首已褪去年少青涩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.19,0:01:14.90,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}恍然发觉早已成长为大人模样
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.32,0:01:19.96,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}人们总说只要努力付出 就能让美梦成真得偿所愿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.99,0:01:21.80,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}可现实哪有这般天真浪漫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.82,0:01:23.88,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}哪怕拼尽全力向上攀登
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.91,0:01:26.01,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}最终结果才是一切 虽然明白
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.04,0:01:27.14,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}却又难以释怀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.16,0:01:28.89,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}坚信终有一天会被人所见证
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.91,0:01:31.18,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}今天也继续迈步向前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.21,0:01:33.98,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}在想要放弃想要认输时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.00,0:01:36.21,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}看见的风景
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.17,0:01:43.76,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}绝望与苦痛交织的黑暗尽头
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.64,0:01:49.12,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}在道路终点等待着的事物
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.14,0:01:52.87,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}哪怕遥远也要亲手将其紧握
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.90,0:01:56.46,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}与理想背道而驰的梦想形态
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.48,0:01:58.13,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}继续追寻即使遍体鳞伤
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.15,0:02:00.55,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}也要坚定前行不止
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.57,0:02:02.34,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}此刻紧握在手中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.36,0:02:04.09,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}我们要从己方彻底改写规则
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.12,0:02:07.72,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}在尚未知晓的世界自由生存
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.74,0:02:09.51,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}即便与理想中的模样大相径庭
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.54,0:02:11.22,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}也要以自己的方式追逐心中所向
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.25,0:02:13.10,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}即便与理想中的模样大相径庭
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.12,0:02:15.17,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}也要以自己的方式追逐心中所向
